{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "7b2a071ea246c57f0c79a88a355eb059737dad2eedb31b7116f0ebf7bc9630c2", "ja": "聖剣士覚醒", "zh": "圣剑士觉醒", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5d1b4e9430748fb710b68bb09cd2fd29357b3d2351e6bf27fe426fae5066f0b0", "ja": "レッスンで連携がうまく行かずに落ちこんで\nしまう杏奈。未来のおかげでやる気になるも\nのの、連携の問題は残ったまま。だが実はゲ\nーム仲間だった百合子のアドバイスで、無事\nダンスをあわせるコツをつかむのだった。", "zh": "杏奈因为训练课程跟不上大家，而垂头丧气。\n虽然多亏未来，让她能提起干劲，但步调不一\n的问题依然存在。但在听了其实是游戏队友的\n百合子的建议，杏奈顺利抓到了跟上大家舞步\n的诀窍。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0fd9eb40ff21f73d802cf99feea04266e5ea99a3d2843dd481ab8912d3ee7de1", "ja": "（今日も、乙女ストーム！の全体レッスンだ。\nみんなはもう、揃ってるかな？）", "zh": "（今天也是『少女风暴！』的团体课程，\n大家都已经到齐了吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "cc903678290365f5f7a04e9038ac03fa884b0bd8dd0d9f72172ff257bd5e6b23", "ja": "……ん。やったね、パーフェクト……。\nアイテム、ゲット……。", "zh": "……嗯，太好了，完美……\n获得……道具……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1002_026yur", "source_sha256": "8d138525c9d63c1872096c8eabc1b1a7044c7af84487d2b3b2fc2bd41d3bc066", "ja": "杏奈ちゃん、そろそろレッスンに……ああっ！？\nそ、そのゲーム、その装備は！？", "zh": "小杏，差不多要去训练课程……啊啊！？\n那、那个游戏，那身装备是！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "8da4dbf9d7832c5ba9f57cc91c77fef4adf765100033956823fb6fa4d2ee8202", "ja": "全世界に7人しかいないという、幻の超レア装備！\nあ、あなたはもしや、あの伝説の……！？", "zh": "全世界只有七个人有的超稀有梦幻装备！\n你、你该不会是那个传说中的……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1004_p", "source_sha256": "34786838eb0b1c87dbc7f728b8c8794b8677fc773160102c1ccb3c04da6051f0", "ja": "ほらほら、ふたりとも。\nレッスンが始まるから、行くぞ。", "zh": "好了好了，你们两个。\n训练课程要开始了，快走吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "28412b6d4465ab6e4e448e86ab5eef8618630b1a95cd99c8cc28c1233c3d1044", "ja": "ああっ、そ、そんな、待ってください！\n私、杏奈ちゃんと話したいことが～……！", "zh": "啊啊，怎、怎么这样，请等一下！\n我有话想跟小杏说……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "df4016b2f24a9cb57e61f9f5fd1018e153de19b958323488e9e5ff46e190b64a", "ja": "はあっ、はあっ……。\n……あっ……！", "zh": "呼、呼……\n……啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "44d821367cfb6d37cd8b4d6554a4ca617f2de7f0f82c820c11abdb62886d1c62", "ja": "きゃっ……！？", "zh": "呀啊……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1009_p", "source_sha256": "98b72d2b0f990c7f92e79fd841fc6853f5c519ad0e3ae904b752bba67abb3634", "ja": "ふたりとも、大丈夫か！？", "zh": "你们两位没事吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1010_024ann", "source_sha256": "39b7f72f628d8e1c202074c74721a9c6fd9bf73bd7694f3cb5fde5c466a81696", "ja": "うん……大丈夫……でも、ぶつかっちゃった……。\n百合子さん、大丈夫……？", "zh": "嗯……没事……但是撞在一起了……\n百合子，你还好吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "3062a85c3e18b479efbcd431d169ca51d35ce0fbbf532f628303b3e7b24ce66d", "ja": "う、うん。私も、ちょっと驚いちゃっただけ。\n杏奈ちゃんこそ、ケガしてない？", "zh": "没、没事，我也是有点吓到而已。\n小杏你才是，有没有受伤？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1012_024ann", "source_sha256": "ef67a220069786d0edcff50cf588550650cef65aa264b2917aef4afcab67563a", "ja": "平気……。けど、杏奈……全然、動き、\n合わせられなくて……ゴメンなさい……。", "zh": "没事……但是，杏奈……动作完全\n跟不上大家……对不起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "0d8c805f9cceed942f451d71d54d99a2dacabaf59aa21635b85f0e7ee64c748e", "ja": "ヘーキヘーキ♪\n時間はまだあるし、もう1回やってみよ♪", "zh": "没事没事～♪\n毕竟还有时间，再练一次看看吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "c90239f95ce140bbde6bb903da04ec1670ea9fd289bd496b04d71a24bb6c043f", "ja": "……ん。わかった……。", "zh": "……嗯，我知道了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1015_p", "source_sha256": "ce5d234b24ac7ec85594d4eda0fdfc413c898a33a4ab9a26df8c22774906b665", "ja": "みんな、お疲れ。\nそろそろ休憩にしようか。", "zh": "大家辛苦了，\n差不多可以休息了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1016_024ann", "source_sha256": "1e8a1ebec1313c77db20003b8057895f0c13ea6d2530c6145ae61f259918f341", "ja": "……やっぱり……、ダンス、\nあんまりうまく、できなかった……。", "zh": "……果然……舞，\n还是跳得不太好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1017_024ann", "source_sha256": "b49f8e11f3c2415a76cbe40dc41de484e04b7814615ac317cec75607d01f6006", "ja": "連携も、全然ダメだし……。杏奈、運動、\n苦手だから……。ダンス、向いてないのかも……。", "zh": "也没办法配合大家……因为杏奈\n不擅长运动……可能不太适合跳舞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1018_p", "source_sha256": "330523775a77c3ec92b3d7099de4cd93853e50325b16fa901605c6ed16865eb6", "ja": "（杏奈、落ち込んでしまったな。頑張っているのに、\n結果がなかなか出ない以上、無理もないが……）", "zh": "（杏奈十分沮丧呢。她明明这么努力，\n却迟迟做不出成果，也难免她会这样……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1019_p", "source_sha256": "82b95dcb45adbc449eff2e50ce85fc36a9161497fe55162b8a60076fa45dab98", "ja": "杏奈、失敗ぐらい気にするな。\nこれから、できるようになればいいんだから。", "zh": "杏奈，失败这种小事你就别放在心上了。\n只要接下来能够学会就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1020_024ann", "source_sha256": "0386cbf6600f098df3d2a8350bdfb160a3ae2517e8aee46c4612d5c220dec1bf", "ja": "……できるように、なる……かな……？\nあんまり、自信……ないかも、です。", "zh": "……真的学得会……吗……？\n杏奈可能……没有什么自信。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1021_024ann", "source_sha256": "c73ede4d2ce4906559d99bac1fd643e3a3979d971aeb7ec54d39fe2e6ed43195", "ja": "……休憩、終わるまで……。\n杏奈……ゲーム、やってるね……。", "zh": "……休息时间结束之前……\n杏奈……先去玩游戏啰……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1022_p", "source_sha256": "c539d07fd54ba93b8a4992aa5e5b1de746fc1e8a843a459c1027977ac3b354a3", "ja": "杏奈……。", "zh": "杏奈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1023_014mir", "source_sha256": "3a399bd559b2eea4e089b11476826d04a02fa8f984b0e9d3437876bcd8f22b12", "ja": "{$P$}さん、どうしましょう……。\n杏奈、落ち込んじゃったみたいです……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，怎么办……\n杏奈看起来好沮丧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1024_p", "source_sha256": "c6694a66a55293f6a98c2d6222cc799749bd44fe4dc7958740f67c8d99d9c616", "ja": "そうだな……未来、タイミングを見て、\n杏奈に声を掛けてもらえるか？", "zh": "这个嘛……未来，你能找个好时机，\n去跟杏奈聊聊吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1025_p", "source_sha256": "32dbce52cbb6e94c469750b2ce3751fda318da0f35e69e482637084d32698254", "ja": "乙女ストーム！のリーダーは未来だ。\nふたりで、杏奈をしっかり励まそう！", "zh": "毕竟『少女风暴！』的队长是未来，\n我们一起去鼓励杏奈吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1026_014mir", "source_sha256": "53cfd922d46478a5149b85b2da63804210ee862a2018c0bed2ec4d0b08198862", "ja": "{$P$}さん……は、はいっ！\n私、頑張りますっ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……好、好的！\n我会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1027_se", "source_sha256": "e48a0fe392c8c11b21aab162c22c5c11d1462423cb3055c95d0cb1353321f41d", "ja": "ピコンピコン……♪", "zh": "叮咚叮咚……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1028_024ann", "source_sha256": "7c8f057758cba4a91de7fa5a056bb3b37dcde89c1d0f176e323b9d224cde8b46", "ja": "……フルコン……クリア……。\n…………。", "zh": "……Full Combo……过关……\n…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1029_p", "source_sha256": "52e241f333294adda22196df090eb9f6e3a30d2ab2a1f7f2de6ae9c119469c93", "ja": "（杏奈は、ゲームをノーミスでクリアした。\nでも、ちっとも嬉しくなさそうだ……）", "zh": "（杏奈零失误把游戏破关了，\n但她看起来一点都不开心……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1030_014mir", "source_sha256": "56c31c4527cebc1fbfdfb6caa38d4744d6a114d3fa06126bc2f97a68bd7d9b1e", "ja": "わぁ～♪\n杏奈って、ゲーム、すっごく上手だね♪", "zh": "哇～♪\n杏奈你好会打电动喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1031_024ann", "source_sha256": "e0b56b0e4906ca9b62ec018e618c997e99b86e196ce6b63cdcd0cc69d1c41038", "ja": "え……。み、未来……？", "zh": "咦……未、未来……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1032_014mir", "source_sha256": "b7425248d63b7d7222d00f0b739abba0efbd77d363994f9daf6587bb7cd97c2b", "ja": "えへへ。ちょっと話しようと思ったんだけど、\n杏奈、ゲームに夢中だったから。", "zh": "嘿嘿，我想跟你聊聊天，\n但杏奈玩得好认真。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1033_014mir", "source_sha256": "f552c00b5ebca5104535cbe93bff5b7df42d26ff18e76b8ebb3a126b26dfd54b", "ja": "終わってから話そうと思って、待ってたんだー♪\nそうですよね、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "我就想说等你玩完再说好了──♪\n没错吧？{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1034_p", "source_sha256": "95d842997dc62a75ac1a0da2995614139cec7b36e3a2c7eff4451fe630e1fa72", "ja": "ああ。それにしても、杏奈は本当にゲームが上手いな。\n相当やりこんだんじゃないか？", "zh": "是啊。不过话说回来，杏奈真的很擅长电玩呢，\n应该花了不少功夫吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1035_024ann", "source_sha256": "b174f7439762c353a051e4de920d35e1060e8fb1b91ccd60a66efce79d43d5b4", "ja": "うん……結構、練習した……かも……。", "zh": "嗯……练得满久的……吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1036_014mir", "source_sha256": "b98037dfc521fdbc0272b8944d1b72c921360724d6a398de50b91888e0ee49f4", "ja": "やっぱり、そうなんだ！\nじゃあ絶対、ダンスもうまくできるようになるよ♪", "zh": "果然是这样啊！\n那一定也可以把舞步练起来的啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1037_024ann", "source_sha256": "11a9d9c356f48b6f64d5cb19e5ac4073e935eacf17ee62278697f1100f8880b3", "ja": "……？　ゲームが、上手なのと……\nダンス、関係ないんじゃ……？", "zh": "……？擅长电玩……\n和跳舞没关系吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1038_014mir", "source_sha256": "967d501ccf287a929194af69cbf76d835494aa08f59a8e68d14b1b68fc48f964", "ja": "あれっ？　そうなのかな……？　えっと、そんなこと\nないですよね、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "咦？是这样吗……？我想想，应该没这回事吧，\n{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1039_p", "source_sha256": "f3095c24b6b59d89b3aee5f4ac3ae9f152471daecb34e0a9e5a830db45c548ff", "ja": "ああ、ゲームとダンスは関係ある！　音ゲーで、\n杏奈のリズム感は鍛えられている……はずだからな。", "zh": "是啊，电玩和跳舞有关联的！因为杏奈你\n透过音乐游戏而锻炼出了节奏感……应该是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1040_014mir", "source_sha256": "cefa4fb260a366793045dd0e96a9e3e54b0d38fb2e26fe85cc031afa0770d4b6", "ja": "あ、やっぱりそうなんだ♪\nなら絶対踊れるようになるよ、杏奈！", "zh": "啊，果然是这样啊♪\n那你一定学得会的啦，杏奈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1041_024ann", "source_sha256": "827b33d27abfe4feae9aa454a715f22f6a89c2e4c36cd40ce28d73ce18d4259f", "ja": "そう、かな……。\n杏奈……何か、そんな気がしてきた……かも。", "zh": "是吗……\n杏奈……也开始这样想了……吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1042_p", "source_sha256": "4de7e4bb87a1c5e2ff114d278ad84fcd274280ecdd2b61be2a04cfd6d2acbaf9", "ja": "よし、そろそろ休憩も終わりだな。\nもう一度挑戦してみよう、杏奈。", "zh": "好，休息时间也差不多结束了，\n再挑战一次看看吧，杏奈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1043_p", "source_sha256": "82cd4750ca7aa1d827e9b80b3737d1533f2449e9ce7f4531b255a52d398bcdaa", "ja": "今日できなくても、まだ明日がある。\n何度だって、チャレンジするのみだ！", "zh": "就算今天练不好，也还有明天。\n只要反复挑战就对了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1044_024ann", "source_sha256": "daca2a5b29e575651b786582e69b17154b1a37b5f3e94dffd0db345f379f34b8", "ja": "{$P$}さん……うん。\n杏奈……頑張って、みる……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……嗯，\n杏奈……会试着努力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1045_014mir", "source_sha256": "a7493613950fc6f9d3babd27058c5b598a0732a3695af681f282277bd657cb01", "ja": "やった♪\n頑張ろうね、杏奈！", "zh": "太好了♪\n一起加油吧，杏奈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1046_p", "source_sha256": "5d66139166f87b646de70d7637ef9e5539db6d006ccb633a37bc0cef497f2da0", "ja": "（未来のおかげで、杏奈はやる気になってくれた。\nけど、まだまだ上手くいかない……）", "zh": "（多亏了未来，杏奈也提起了干劲。\n但事情还是没那么顺利……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1047_p", "source_sha256": "0d340f555b8be634a20d1761a42ea07c4e147f8a1956c6ccd2f583ce9df455b7", "ja": "（何か、杏奈の心に響くような……\n実感を持てるアドバイスができればいいんだが……）", "zh": "（要是可以给出能打动杏奈的心……\n比较真实一点的建议就好了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1048_024ann", "source_sha256": "cd7d81ba4da63ba12692e68f43343d481edf68d76dbb4465e8362f80eb1740ca", "ja": "……あ。……また……動き、ズレちゃった……。\nうまく、連携して動くの……難しい……。", "zh": "……啊……动作……又乱掉了……\n要和大家统一步伐……好难……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1049_026yur", "source_sha256": "33777a0eb4f11f703d61c7a9cb5615280b1f7352d83b3c0fd86e9be520958ede", "ja": "……ね、ねぇ、杏奈ちゃん。\n私、考えてみたんだけど……。", "zh": "……我、我说啊，小杏，\n我刚刚想了一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1050_026yur", "source_sha256": "87ad014c5eb2b019986abfc8021d53f015cd2644562ae2683949c327336c9fb2", "ja": "ネトゲのコンビネーションをダンスに\n応用したら、うまく連携が取れるんじゃないかな？", "zh": "要是把网游的默契应用在舞步上，\n应该就能顺利和大家同步了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1051_024ann", "source_sha256": "2fc3883e962a664140f6df104dfa45b82a8fcb5f76b777dc37406edd2cdd762c", "ja": "……ネトゲの、コンビネーション……？", "zh": "……网游的默契……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1052_016tsu", "source_sha256": "cdb2f2cf150f7490e3d0fc08364208c3746558c2bedd6e65d05eaa805d5ea1e4", "ja": "え～？　ネトゲとダンスは、関係なくない？", "zh": "咦～？网游和跳舞应该没关系吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1053_p", "source_sha256": "e29aa985e3b5e5dd4702b3dad6eaab01740f2443cd0be38042568fb2b8909ab8", "ja": "いや……そうとも限らないな。\n百合子、いいぞ！　試してみてくれ！", "zh": "不……这还不一定呢，\n百合子，很好！试试看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1054_026yur", "source_sha256": "fa9b2fe966d3adc3aeb16c460fe162f7acccc92941fdc13362090ac784489ff1", "ja": "はいっ！　……さぁ、思い出して、杏奈ちゃん！\n……ううん、白の聖剣士vivid_rabbit！", "zh": "好的！来，回想起来吧，小杏！\n……不对，是白之圣剑士vivid_rabbit！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1055_024ann", "source_sha256": "d498a4d84faf2194e79c7e9f22eddaee7a37d2712567b588f3e7079027d255d0", "ja": "え……。\n百合子さん……どうして、それを……？", "zh": "咦……\n百合子……你为什么会……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1056_026yur", "source_sha256": "3b63444f25f6e628dda59881de8689eef7663449f03441af70f7ca46d7f07279", "ja": "やっぱり、そうだったんだね！　いつもお世話に\nなってます！　私、lilyknightです！", "zh": "果然没错呢！平常受你照顾了！\n我是lilyknight！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1057_024ann", "source_sha256": "814e360012684b6cb9321907aa94e3a68d037da42229e25eb1fb298a8787e18c", "ja": "え……！？\nゆ、百合子さんが、lilyknightさん……！？", "zh": "咦……！？\n百、百合子是lilyknight……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1058_p", "source_sha256": "2e3bd06f095fec8a972d8645c51abba5d2b7ccaac14e1e55cab9f07236e6dbca", "ja": "ふたりとも、盛り上がっているところ悪いんだが……\nそろそろ、レッスンを再開してもいいか？", "zh": "抱歉在你们聊得正热烈的时候打岔……\n但差不多可以开始训练课程了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1059_026yur", "source_sha256": "5cfd927f87e99640fdc72217adafdd1751da71007d036918f4d354c47d5da401", "ja": "はっ、そうでした！　すみません、すぐ始めます！\nvivid_rabbitが相手なら、きっと大丈夫です！", "zh": "啊，对喔！不好意思，我们马上开始！\n和vivid_rabbit组队，一定没问题的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1060_026yur", "source_sha256": "74e51e10761a56b288a952d06213d8f73965313660369e4767b8fc409862f209", "ja": "さぁ、vivid_rabbit！　あなたの聖剣なら\n大丈夫だよ！　私のアシストを信じて！", "zh": "来吧，vivid_rabbit！\n你的圣剑一定可以的！相信我的辅助吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1061_026yur", "source_sha256": "d5d409b94cd1245fac9e37a1ab8ead4e76d5f0ba50c9a7b4d96acaff04f125d9", "ja": "あのアビスガーディアンを倒した時のような、\n華麗な連携を皆に見せよう！！", "zh": "展现和打倒那个深渊护卫时，\n一样华丽的默契给大家看吧！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1062_024ann", "source_sha256": "f28e47de1703b084703dba322a1666e1a5840779502bbe4662cd9b53def89416", "ja": "……そっか……。杏奈、ダンスは苦手……だけど……。\nゲームだと、思えば……。", "zh": "……这样啊……杏奈虽然不擅长……跳舞……\n但只要想成是电玩……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1063_024ann", "source_sha256": "98b8068598988387359eb377b1ba34231fca170625108419d877cb4e9fd9a0d6", "ja": "百合……じゃなくて、lilyknightさん……。\n杏奈……やってみるね……！", "zh": "百合……不，lilyknight……\n杏奈……会试试看的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1064_024ann", "source_sha256": "76a39103c7c4cf38d1a036a63025ce3bb0b12d0c494b43fe15bcb7d03729e448", "ja": "……あ。\n今の……結構、できてた……かも……。", "zh": "……啊，\n刚刚的……好像成功了……吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1065_044miz", "source_sha256": "c2cfac1575c6fa4bfb0367c5037d6e19331ea2525dabb491cab5c18f81e9974c", "ja": "はい。みんなの動きが、綺麗にそろったダンスでした。\nお見事です、望月さん。……私もネトゲやろうかな。", "zh": "是的，刚才大家的舞蹈动作非常整齐。\n真是了不起，望月……我也来打网游好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1066_026yur", "source_sha256": "db70ca99d63e1bf74d2d065e6deecaf6aee6c339504416c1fcf23770a2bde043", "ja": "さすがはvivid_rabbit！\n聖剣士として世界を救う日も近いね！！", "zh": "不愧是vivid_rabbit！\n以圣剑士的身份拯救世界之日也不远了呢！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1067_024ann", "source_sha256": "79398e5b2aca99d8a6b051a98e2885740b577b67cae0ce0df0179b83db70f6e3", "ja": "世界は、救わない……けど……。\n百合子さん……ありがとう……未来も……。", "zh": "没有要拯救世界……但是……\n百合子……谢谢你……还有未来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1068_014mir", "source_sha256": "272e8108d06e857fd8f034488ebc48c9c68474fa9c9731278d031e219373de94", "ja": "ううん！　……よかったですね、\n{$P$}さん♪　でへへ。", "zh": "不会！\n……太好了呢，{$P$}先生♪嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1069_p", "source_sha256": "ed98004486f78c833fa175df4d4a1cf04ac49436f4379c49518f98a6c60840cd", "ja": "（杏奈はダンスを合わせるコツをつかめたようだ。\nそれにしても……）", "zh": "（杏奈似乎掌握到跟上舞步的诀窍了，\n话说回来……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_03_1070_p", "source_sha256": "327124b3cd27f6dd0b16420bb0c7dd51d94c9eacb12fe04ddb5c00056be7b2cd", "ja": "（みんな、ちょっとしたきっかけでどんどん伸びるな。\nこのユニットがどこまで成長するのか……楽しみだ！）", "zh": "（大家只要一个小小的契机，就会不断进步呢。\n这个团体会成长到什么程度……真令人期待！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
